  "contentHtml": "<!--StartFragment--><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">여기에서 작성했던 글이 저장되지 않고 날아가 버렸네요</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">ㅠ    </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;<!--[if !supportEmptyParas]-->&nbsp;<!--[endif]-->&nbsp; </p><p class=\"0\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">자유학기제 주제 선택 수업</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">푸드스타일리스트 탐구 세 번째 활동입니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\">  <!--[if !supportEmptyParas]-->&nbsp;<!--[endif]-->  </p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">전에 재직했던 학교에서 과일을 이용한 탐구를 처음 시도해 보았거든요</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">그 때는 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">5</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">월이어서 다양한 과일을 이용하였습니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\">  <!--[if !supportEmptyParas]--></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 12pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/99D57A465DDC97E61A\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"230\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"1.jpg\" actualwidth=\"230\"  id=\"A_99D57A465DDC97E61AC375\"/>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/99A0A4445DDC97F115\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"265\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"2.jpg\" actualwidth=\"265\"  id=\"A_99A0A4445DDC97F1150562\"/></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\">&nbsp;<!--[endif]-->&nbsp; </p><p class=\"0\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">그 후에 팔레스타인의 학교에서 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">3</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">주간 머물면서 수업한 적이 있는데</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">당시 학생들이 만든 작품중 하나입니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">제목은 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">‘</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">팔레스타인 맨</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">’</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">이고요</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">발표할 때 그가 우리를 영원히 평화롭게 살도록 지켜 줄 것이라고 하여 울컥</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">~</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">했던 기억이 납니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\">  <!--[if !supportEmptyParas]--></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: center; font-size: 12pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/99210C435DDC982608\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"265\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"3.jpg\" actualwidth=\"265\"  id=\"A_99210C435DDC982608F658\"/></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\">&nbsp;<!--[endif]-->  </p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">이번 학교에서는 사과로만 작품을 만들었습니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">요즘 학생들이 과도를 사용해본 경험이 거의 없더군요</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">안전문제가 염려되어 손에 익은 집 과도를 가져오라고 미리 알렸습니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\">  <!--[if !supportEmptyParas]-->&nbsp;<!--[endif]-->  </p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">제가 준비한 것은 특상품 사과를 주문하여 깨끗이 씻고,<span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\"><br></span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: center; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/99AAA0455DDC984F12\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"768\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"사과.jpg\" actualwidth=\"768\"  id=\"A_99AAA0455DDC984F12E5FB\"/></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><!--[if !supportEmptyParas]--><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">접시와 도마를 팔팔 끓는 물에 소독하였습니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">학생들이 가져온 과도도 끓는 물에 넣었습니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: center; font-size: 12pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/992116495DDC98791A\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"768\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"준비물.jpg\" actualwidth=\"768\"  id=\"A_992116495DDC98791ACFC9\"/></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><!--[endif]-->  </p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">학생들도 비눗물과 흐르는 물에 손을 깨끗이 씻은 다음 활동을 시작하였습니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\">  <!--[if !supportEmptyParas]-->&nbsp;<!--[endif]-->  </p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">산출물은 순서대로 이상한 나라의 앨리스, 자연의 신비, 사과 할로윈, 사과가 자라는 나무입니다.&nbsp;<span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\"><br></span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: center; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/99E3444A5DDC98980C\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"768\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"이상한 나라의 앨리스.jpg\" actualwidth=\"768\"  id=\"A_99E3444A5DDC98980C29BC\"/></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: center; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/99EACD425DDC98AB1C\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"768\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"자연의 신비.jpg\" actualwidth=\"768\"  id=\"A_99EACD425DDC98AB1C073E\"/></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: center; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/999A89435DDC98D915\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"768\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"사과 할로윈.jpg\" actualwidth=\"768\"  id=\"A_999A89435DDC98D9156719\"/></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\">  <!--[if !supportEmptyParas]--></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: center; font-size: 12pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/999434505DDC990C16\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"768\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"사과가 자라는 나무.jpg\" actualwidth=\"768\"  id=\"A_999434505DDC990C161BDE\"/></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\">&nbsp;<!--[endif]-->  </p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">화려한 작품을 만드는 것보다 안전한 활동이 더 중요하다고 거듭 강조하였고요</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. 환경 문제를 염두에 두고 이쑤시개를 일</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">절 사용하지 않았습니다. 완성한 다음 모둠별 발표가 끝나고 사이좋게 나누어 먹었습니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. (탐구 활동이 시작되기 전에 수분, 수정, 열매의 구조에 관한 이론 수업도 하였습니다.) &nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">과도 사용이 서툰 중1의 산출물인 점을 감안하고 보아주시면 고맙겠습니다. ^^&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\">  <!--[if !supportEmptyParas]-->&nbsp;<!--[endif]-->  </p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">    </span></p><div class=\"hwp_editor_board_content\" id=\"hwpEditorBoardContent\" data-jsonlen=\"13769\" data-hjsonver=\"1.0\"><!--[data-hwpjson]{ \"documentPr\": { \"di\": \"\", \"dp\": { \"dn\": \"test.hwp\", \"ta\": 1, \"d1\": 5, \"d2\": 1, \"dv\": 0, \"dr\": 1, \"do\": 1, \"vj\": \"1.1\", \"an\": \"Hancom Office Hangul\", \"av\": \"10, 0, 0, 8223\", \"ao\": \"WIN\", \"ab\": \"32\", \"ar\": \"LE\", \"as\": \"Windows_8\" }, \"dis\": false, \"ds\": { \"ti\": \"\", \"la\": \"ko\", \"cr\": \"\", \"su\": \"\", \"de\": \"\", \"cd\": \"2019-11-26T12:10:33.988Z\", \"md\": \"1601-01-01T09:00:00.000Z\", \"pd\": \"1601-01-01T09:00:00.000Z\", \"ke\": \"\" } }, \"dh\": { \"do\": { \"pa\": 1, \"fo\": 1, \"en\": 1, \"pi\": 1, \"tb\": 1, \"eq\": 1 }, \"fo\": [ ], \"cd\": { \"tp\": 0, \"lc\": { \"af\": false, \"ui\": false, \"fu\": false, \"dn\": false, \"ul\": false, \"el\": false, \"at\": false, \"tq\": false, \"da\": false, \"dw\": false, \"dj\": false, \"bc\": false, \"bu\": false, \"al\": false, \"ab\": false, \"ap\": false, \"an\": false, \"aa\": false, \"ds\": false, \"de\": false, \"as\": false, \"cp\": false, \"ao\": false, \"et\": false, \"ay\": false, \"am\": false, \"a1\": fals